@startuml habit-service-class-diagram
title Level 3: Code - Class Diagram (habit-service) - FR-13\nOwner: Mostafa Khamis Abozead
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
  BackgroundColor<<component>> #D5EFE0
  BorderColor<<component>> #2E8B57
}
skinparam interface {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
}
hide empty members

legend right
  |<#D5EFE0>   | Class of a component |
  |<#FFFFFF>   | Interface / domain class |
  | Solid arrow, open head | Uses (required interface / class) |
  | Dotted arrow, hollow head | Implements (provided interface) |
  | Filled diamond | Composition |
  | Plain line | Association |
endlegend

interface IHabit <<provided>> {
  +createHabit(studentId, data): Habit
  +markDone(habitId, date): void
  +getStreak(habitId): int
  +linkToGoal(habitId, goalId): void
  +getHabits(studentId): List<Habit>
}

class HabitService <<component>> {
  -goal: IGoal
  -repository: IHabitRepository
  -streakCalculator: StreakCalculator
  --
  +createHabit(...) / markDone(...)
  +getStreak(...) / linkToGoal(...)
  +getHabits(...)
}

IHabit <|.. HabitService
class StreakCalculator <<component>> {
  +calculate(completions, frequency): int
}
HabitService --> StreakCalculator

interface IGoal <<required - Academic service>> {
  +createGoal(studentId, data): Goal
  +updateGoal(goalId, data): Goal
  +completeGoal(goalId): void
  +archiveGoal(goalId): void
  +restoreGoal(goalId): void
  +deleteGoal(goalId): void
  +getGoals(studentId, status): List<Goal>
}

HabitService --> IGoal
interface IHabitRepository <<required - Database>> {
  +save(item: Habit): void
  +findById(id): Habit
  +findByOwner(ownerId): List<Habit>
}

HabitService --> IHabitRepository
class Habit {
  -habitId: String
  -name: String
  -frequency: String
  -reminderTime: Time
  -goalId: String
}
class HabitCompletion {
  -date: Date
}
IHabitRepository --> Habit
Habit *-- "0..*" HabitCompletion
note bottom of HabitService
SOLID applied:
S - HabitService only coordinates; StreakCalculator each do one job.
O - new behaviour is added by new implementations, not by editing HabitService.
L - HabitService can replace any other IHabit implementation.
I - IHabit has only the operations its clients use.
D - HabitService depends on interfaces (IGoal, IHabitRepository), not on concrete classes.
end note
@enduml
